<Base title="About Litbuy Sheet Lab | Independent Product Discovery" description="How Litbuy Sheet Lab uses the FindSpreadsheet catalog, labels reference prices and separates listing photos from warehouse QC."><main class="long-guide information-page"><h1>About Litbuy Sheet Lab</h1><p>Litbuy Sheet Lab is an independent product-discovery website. We organize source catalog links so visitors can compare products and continue to a buying platform. We are not Litbuy and do not process purchases, hold customer funds, inspect orders or arrange shipping.</p><h2>Where product information comes from</h2><p>Our current catalog is a historical FindSpreadsheet export dated October 19, 2026. It includes product names, identifiers, reference CNY prices and available source listing photos. The catalog is not a live stock feed. Some names are abbreviated in the supplied data; check the original listing for complete details.</p><h2>What photos mean</h2><p>Seller and catalog galleries are labelled as listing photos. They are not independently verified warehouse QC. Actual inspection photos belong to an order or warehouse item and should be checked in the platform account.</p><h2>How prices work</h2><p>The original archived CNY amount is the reference. Optional currency conversions use the displayed exchange-rate reference date, with original CNY shown when a rate is unavailable. Litbuy may use its own conversion rate and fees. Confirm the full checkout amount before payment.</p><h2>Referral links</h2><p>Some outgoing links include referral identifiers. Read our <a href="/disclosure/">referral disclosure</a>, <a href="/privacy/">privacy information</a> or <a href="/contact/">contact guidance</a>.</p></main></Base>
